    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0018",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s02-p135-02700-s006",
      "sentenceText": "At time two, the students were also asked to look back at the beginning of the semester and evaluate how independent, self-confident, and socially skilled they were.",
      "sentenceSha256": "0b40a8b7c1ddee82a27c9753ff3f28d53696d22165928f057a0596011965bc17",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s02-p135-02700-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-013",
      "parentFingerprint": "214f2eccdd8d86557e05b078188bd237cc5d3addca641cf31ff7de0c0f7f9707",
      "passageSha256": "daac6f97c746dad62ac66a40eb1af16f67520332e16f592a4fd87a5b44cb9f52",
      "pdfPages": [
        135
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0019",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s02-p135-02700-s010",
      "sentenceText": "Their September ratings were significantly better than their November ratings.",
      "sentenceSha256": "a3f31069327a49a462d32688fd2d67fd8f528368c219c28c3ce9b1742ff0cb8b",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s02-p135-02700-r008-011",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-014",
      "parentFingerprint": "0e620e7586be3099a6f797ab754f3e832e5e5024aa93159d59f11a0bce45fdff",
      "passageSha256": "adbc5cef42e3bdb5be3441ccaa068bcdf94c8d998ed606209c73c73fa13c7ebf",
      "pdfPages": [
        135
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0020",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s02-p135-02700-s012",
      "sentenceText": "Wilson and Ross entitled their paper “From Chump to Champ: People’s Appraisals of Their Earlier and Present Selves.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "84ac5087934eec3e1c4856a133a2bd184f61e5d450ec96cccb1be09636b7f4e3",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s02-p135-02700-r012-015",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-015",
      "parentFingerprint": "3ef6ab62f33a786c4158a9c8358452b65520acb1cc2132db55028eababee9002",
      "passageSha256": "d33b4d9ac24cf8edfa91e6f0916a6dd1ed337d73466fe886273cb41590b2b440",
      "pdfPages": [
        135,
        136
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0021",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s02-p135-02700-s014",
      "sentenceText": "To borrow Tim Wilson’s terminology, we are constantly story editing.",
      "sentenceSha256": "02fd5c33b4fc7efb3b819d9108010c21f39eea1c5810f312062ede1d51668828",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s02-p135-02700-r012-015",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-015",
      "parentFingerprint": "3ef6ab62f33a786c4158a9c8358452b65520acb1cc2132db55028eababee9002",
      "passageSha256": "d33b4d9ac24cf8edfa91e6f0916a6dd1ed337d73466fe886273cb41590b2b440",
      "pdfPages": [
        135,
        136
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0022",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s02-p135-02700-s015",
      "sentenceText": "The derogation of the past self is one editing method.",
      "sentenceSha256": "47bb8c3a5c8fe78168f3a6ad81312f5e7b9a1dd06ee97d55111b3218416121d5",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s02-p135-02700-r012-015",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-015",
      "parentFingerprint": "3ef6ab62f33a786c4158a9c8358452b65520acb1cc2132db55028eababee9002",
      "passageSha256": "d33b4d9ac24cf8edfa91e6f0916a6dd1ed337d73466fe886273cb41590b2b440",
      "pdfPages": [
        135,
        136
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0023",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s02-p135-02700-s017",
      "sentenceText": "So I can say that, compared to my youth, I have become far less shy.",
      "sentenceSha256": "4dcef29bfd31a06f80e8473a3a9ee10e294c85ebd5a5da2446091ca876655b63",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s02-p135-02700-r016-019",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-016",
      "parentFingerprint": "ea014e06ebd9b751e74e586a61078de88937da9c847209eca296204e18284d3b",
      "passageSha256": "110bd63568263b294de9d3d48d2cd8169e0f1275be97c6ac4467ceec1e0c1e52",
      "pdfPages": [
        136
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0024",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s02-p135-02700-s019",
      "sentenceText": "Compared to when I was twenty-five, I have become a better writer.",
      "sentenceSha256": "ea9cc025824a827a878cfca441cb8cd5ec6325fd5d76d0d672c48ed54b91d9ca",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s02-p135-02700-r016-019",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-016",
      "parentFingerprint": "ea014e06ebd9b751e74e586a61078de88937da9c847209eca296204e18284d3b",
      "passageSha256": "110bd63568263b294de9d3d48d2cd8169e0f1275be97c6ac4467ceec1e0c1e52",
      "pdfPages": [
        136
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0025",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s03-p136-02625-s001",
      "sentenceText": "We can derogate our past self in many domains, from maturity to writing skills to morality.",
      "sentenceSha256": "b7febbc18fc60599cf861c808e6a0c91f9215bc4d5c06edc947ea5f806c204cf",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s03-p136-02625-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-018",
      "parentFingerprint": "a856a908bc8546906b0c516a7dd9dd2ff38613357156e8a9915b3623e0abdb4a",
      "passageSha256": "57541adfe23e2a95889e4f9f954460648f4bb23ca6c0982686dfd974e05eb540",
      "pdfPages": [
        136
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0026",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s03-p136-02625-s003",
      "sentenceText": "For instance, if you are a marathon runner of my age, you know exactly how you did ten years ago, five years ago, and last month.",
      "sentenceSha256": "fa624ec35ddb10eebfb21a930fd37a0bcd3189a37e324352cce48740eaf05796",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s03-p136-02625-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-018",
      "parentFingerprint": "a856a908bc8546906b0c516a7dd9dd2ff38613357156e8a9915b3623e0abdb4a",
      "passageSha256": "57541adfe23e2a95889e4f9f954460648f4bb23ca6c0982686dfd974e05eb540",
      "pdfPages": [
        136
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0027",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s03-p136-02625-s005",
      "sentenceText": "If you are in the second semester of your first year in college, you remember exactly how you did academically in your first semester.",
      "sentenceSha256": "789df42702b3be3cac00a0bd885ca2463d7012d290389f4f0d3773c713f587e8",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s03-p136-02625-r005-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-019",
      "parentFingerprint": "2918ad4d3a7f9145ee6c1fddfaa00685bd2fd9fb5fa5ebf09d6fff1d659ee100",
      "passageSha256": "67261caa009d8a14fec1980d7c8ed9a106b7c15c9a184d64ee91b2e29ccb5b5b",
      "pdfPages": [
        136
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0028",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s03-p136-04380-s001",
      "sentenceText": "But, even on more objective measures, people are drawn to a narrative about personal growth.",
      "sentenceSha256": "2e81804d43fac79850186ede9385794ff652d84308722306af1fe7070cd11ae7",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s03-p136-04380-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-020",
      "parentFingerprint": "2c582038e831de0b14df3b0cdc84141a361bbf589c302bdb680f7a69781eeb75",
      "passageSha256": "c20ea964fff83f82d0e222621b4ed911303295b71f26692a952f769d7cbd8a86",
      "pdfPages": [
        136
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0029",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s03-p136-04380-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Tim Wilson and Patricia Linville carried out an intriguing experiment to show how that can take place.",
      "sentenceSha256": "3f453ed5d884fb47999fb7673968934525cfe81bc45cf202731e40bae7679a8e",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s03-p136-04380-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-020",
      "parentFingerprint": "2c582038e831de0b14df3b0cdc84141a361bbf589c302bdb680f7a69781eeb75",
      "passageSha256": "c20ea964fff83f82d0e222621b4ed911303295b71f26692a952f769d7cbd8a86",
      "pdfPages": [
        136
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0030",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s03-p136-04380-s005",
      "sentenceText": "One interviewee said his GPA increased from 2.0 to 2.6 to 3.2.",
      "sentenceSha256": "3afd736073144b6c99f52b961d2f1858c3a0d35020f71258fb83601e0b31d294",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s03-p136-04380-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-021",
      "parentFingerprint": "4160e094b446976c2f74b49b75012181ad8a243e66b38de7532e703f168cb054",
      "passageSha256": "42e381b98434a9d6c01ce3cac8265f08ebd7ac97b1427d0898c5b0a8bae26658",
      "pdfPages": [
        136
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0031",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s03-p136-04380-s007",
      "sentenceText": "The other half of the participants did not receive any information.",
      "sentenceSha256": "d2eb5614eca206b66bc4b6b7c37825abf2115d58d6bde4ea2d5492cb30a245af",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s03-p136-04380-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-021",
      "parentFingerprint": "4160e094b446976c2f74b49b75012181ad8a243e66b38de7532e703f168cb054",
      "passageSha256": "42e381b98434a9d6c01ce3cac8265f08ebd7ac97b1427d0898c5b0a8bae26658",
      "pdfPages": [
        136
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0032",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s03-p137-03480-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Wilson and Linville’s experiment shows that having a role model— knowing someone who went through similar, tough experiences but ended up successful—can provide the idea and hope that it is possible to improve and survive.",
      "sentenceSha256": "64e896b96488c1d11e44cf067a92810c1b4c927ff78fd8d1fda7ee25821c910c",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s03-p137-03480-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-025",
      "parentFingerprint": "1f60ee2295589135eba833a0781b3ef8febe46ec70afb2e929e564ab34463cb1",
      "passageSha256": "81869ed3e271f9e29fe643c7d333732a43df7200abb07c2e0de8017041eaa68b",
      "pdfPages": [
        137
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0033",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s03-p137-03480-s002",
      "sentenceText": "The key example of story editing here was how the students viewed their bad academic performance in the first semester.",
      "sentenceSha256": "6975a5d6bb5a65f84ebfcf7c6dc371e375f4ade9dbe8a2d33f64c35562f07ca5",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s03-p137-03480-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-025",
      "parentFingerprint": "1f60ee2295589135eba833a0781b3ef8febe46ec70afb2e929e564ab34463cb1",
      "passageSha256": "81869ed3e271f9e29fe643c7d333732a43df7200abb07c2e0de8017041eaa68b",
      "pdfPages": [
        137
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0034",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s03-p137-04845-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Similarly, for most of us, physics is a tough subject.",
      "sentenceSha256": "fe45ed1106a32058099e2470cf38a7c8d86bd1f1933ba9d0c282ea3fcee4aae0",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s03-p137-04845-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-026",
      "parentFingerprint": "56c8ea44c7d68cffadc57e04eee422fcbaa1db17f1dedafad5621375f4130105",
      "passageSha256": "d84dadef83adb9412b12968ee177810cd6106121497bd8167acfbac9081320a5",
      "pdfPages": [
        137
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0035",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s03-p137-04845-s003",
      "sentenceText": "So, when we must learn E = mc2, it is hard for us to identify with Einstein.",
      "sentenceSha256": "9f5dcf210189faf0c116cb1d49afdc1bc0101ac273bdcfd62e79815a679c1c1f",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s03-p137-04845-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-026",
      "parentFingerprint": "56c8ea44c7d68cffadc57e04eee422fcbaa1db17f1dedafad5621375f4130105",
      "passageSha256": "d84dadef83adb9412b12968ee177810cd6106121497bd8167acfbac9081320a5",
      "pdfPages": [
        137
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0036",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s03-p137-04845-s005",
      "sentenceText": "He was dissatisfied with his theory of relativity because it did not include electromagnetism.",
      "sentenceSha256": "d7621fb7a9fbeba318d1e87d74a141050d2ef7586ff430629e197ef994203a8c",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s03-p137-04845-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-027",
      "parentFingerprint": "715567751c263474d522ad1b96cd6cd35d890ac9ab1aff3d32f5b4c242c932aa",
      "passageSha256": "0c4c13b18c1fde898b3e14e217d1101b4082000fa8ac5b3af5020d215226ed52",
      "pdfPages": [
        137,
        138
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0037",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s03-p137-04845-s006",
      "sentenceText": "He tried to integrate electromagnetic and gravitational phenomena.",
      "sentenceSha256": "446bfb58bf967e2c0e521a8f570e3a88ec83709838dc18b8648b0e5f9f6f7dd9",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s03-p137-04845-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-027",
      "parentFingerprint": "715567751c263474d522ad1b96cd6cd35d890ac9ab1aff3d32f5b4c242c932aa",
      "passageSha256": "0c4c13b18c1fde898b3e14e217d1101b4082000fa8ac5b3af5020d215226ed52",
      "pdfPages": [
        137,
        138
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0038",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s03-p137-04845-s007",
      "sentenceText": "Unfortunately, he was never able to do this, despite the fact that he spent the last twenty-five years of his life on it.",
      "sentenceSha256": "484cbad190d30a9bcb0908680ce3206c5e7fad8cd942f27a112212eaee79efd9",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s03-p137-04845-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-027",
      "parentFingerprint": "715567751c263474d522ad1b96cd6cd35d890ac9ab1aff3d32f5b4c242c932aa",
      "passageSha256": "0c4c13b18c1fde898b3e14e217d1101b4082000fa8ac5b3af5020d215226ed52",
      "pdfPages": [
        137,
        138
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0039",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s03-p138-01140-s003",
      "sentenceText": "They also thought that Galileo, Newton, and Einstein had to work hard, whereas those in the accomplishment condition thought they were born geniuses.",
      "sentenceSha256": "62c815077fad3223988ce8c2270709c608c9ce9204d63c540e4a1260b5243d91",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s03-p138-01140-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-029",
      "parentFingerprint": "4958c14f44f18a91e040b85d18cf80b2e13ceb7409784fb43f2b8224e20b2534",
      "passageSha256": "e2eb4c40cf397c2585ae22d72cc852ac13fd1f5932b7ec81b958e294ef41fc51",
      "pdfPages": [
        138
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0040",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s03-p138-01140-s006",
      "sentenceText": "There have been numerous intervention studies of this sort conducted in diverse settings since Wilson and Linville’s seminal 1982 paper.",
      "sentenceSha256": "59fd57c6627efa1540f0df8d8dba772f50e96cef702d78a1ceab26251a7379a9",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s03-p138-01140-r004-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-030",
      "parentFingerprint": "fac48aa8cf76c17cbf4cb81b071dcae43969cd465fd625d4ae7770454d851001",
      "passageSha256": "323a3ec5854481b68024c4d29261f7d46c0337de5f051a5b096fd31f0d17a6dc",
      "pdfPages": [
        138
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0041",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s03-p138-01140-s007",
      "sentenceText": "For me, the main lesson of Redirect is that our story is in our control.",
      "sentenceSha256": "43d7f842b558c8f22e7d6d2a210dae7b71c04f0f7ad81027c30e35bbaf08ee1a",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s03-p138-01140-r004-007",
